      "comment" : "Button that dismisses a dialog, stops rendering the time-lapse, closes Settings › Advanced › Share with a Note without doing anything, or leaves feedback mode on the painting screen (its accessibility label), and the Refine screen's Cancel, which puts back what it opened with, and the alert shown when feedback couldn't be sent (it keeps what the painter wrote)",
